---
name: Publish Content Views
description: Choose which content views to leave untouched during this publish.
spec:
  - question_name: Content views to exclude
    question_description: >-
      These content views will NOT get a new version. The emergency
      content view is excluded by default because it is published on its own schedule.
      A multiselect is used deliberately - AAP returns it as a list, which is what the
      playbook's reject filter needs.
    variable: exclude_content_views
    type: multiselect
    choices: {{ ([sat_emergency_content_view] + (sat_additional_excludable_content_views | default([]))) }}
    default: {{ sat_emergency_content_view | quote }}
    required: false
